{"verse_key": "10:89", "surah": 10, "verse": 89, "text_uthmani": "قَالَ قَدْ أُجِيبَت دَّعْوَتُكُمَا فَٱسْتَقِيمَا وَلَا تَتَّبِعَآنِّ سَبِيلَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "[Allāh] said, \"Your supplication has been answered.\"<sup foot_note=196458>1</sup> So remain on a right course and follow not the way of those who do not know.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1935490, "verse_to_ms": 1950560, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالَ", "start_ms": 1935490, "end_ms": 1936380}, {"i": 1, "text": "قَدْ", "start_ms": 1936380, "end_ms": 1936780}, {"i": 2, "text": "أُجِيبَت", "start_ms": 1936780, "end_ms": 1937630}, {"i": 3, "text": "دَّعْوَتُكُمَا", "start_ms": 1937630, "end_ms": 1939040}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَٱسْتَقِيمَا", "start_ms": 1939040, "end_ms": 1940410}, {"i": 5, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 1940410, "end_ms": 1941010}, {"i": 6, "text": "تَتَّبِعَآنِّ", "start_ms": 1941010, "end_ms": 1945299}, {"i": 7, "text": "سَبِيلَ", "start_ms": 1945300, "end_ms": 1946040}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1946040, "end_ms": 1947140}, {"i": 9, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1947140, "end_ms": 1947550}, {"i": 10, "text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "start_ms": 1947550, "end_ms": 1950095}]}